  "summary": "by 新世界的大门",
  "content": "<p>观看 JetBrains for HarmonyOS 演示视频。</p>\n<p>发现给 linux-musl-aarch64 的二进制签个名就能直接在鸿蒙上跑。</p>\n<h2>HarmonyBrew<a href=\"https://blog.xinshijiededa.men/daily/52/#harmonybrew\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><span>#</span></a></h2>\n<p>《IT 之家》的新闻稿称，<a href=\"https://www.ithome.com/0/963/893.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">鸿蒙 PC 包管理器 HarmonyBrew 已支持 4763 条常用命令安装/卸载</a>。小虚空 coin 出了一个“蒙酿”的名字。</p>\n<p>使用中，遇到如下问题：</p>\n<figure><pre><code><span><span>localhost</span><span> ~</span><span> %</span><span> brew</span><span> install</span><span> typst</span></span>\n<span><span>==</span><span>&gt; </span><span>Fetching</span><span> downloads</span><span> for:</span><span> typst</span></span>\n<span><span>✔️</span><span> Bottle</span><span> ca-certificates</span><span> (2026-05-14)                Downloaded  112.6KB/112.6KB</span></span>\n<span><span>✔️</span><span> Bottle</span><span> typst</span><span> (0.14.2)                              Downloaded   20.0MB/ 20.0MB</span></span>\n<span><span>✔️</span><span> Bottle</span><span> openssl@3</span><span> (3.6.3)                           Downloaded   11.1MB/ 11.1MB</span></span>\n<span><span>==</span><span>&gt; </span><span>Installing</span><span> dependencies</span><span> for</span><span> typst:</span><span> ca-certificates</span><span> and</span><span> openssl@3</span></span>\n<span><span>==</span><span>&gt; </span><span>Installing</span><span> typst</span><span> dependency:</span><span> ca-certificates</span></span>\n<span><span>==</span><span>&gt; </span><span>Pouring</span><span> ca-certificates-2026-05-14.arm64_ohos.bottle.tar.gz</span></span>\n<span><span>Loaded</span><span> 125</span><span> system</span><span> certificates</span></span>\n<span><span>Loaded</span><span> 23</span><span> Mozilla</span><span> certificates</span></span>\n<span><span>==</span><span>&gt; </span><span>CA</span><span> certificates</span><span> have</span><span> been</span><span> bootstrapped</span><span> from</span><span> the</span><span> system</span><span> CA</span><span> store</span><span> at</span><span> /etc/ssl/</span></span>\n<span><span>🍺</span><span>  /storage/Users/currentUser/.harmonybrew/Cellar/ca-certificates/2026-05-14:</span><span> 4</span><span> files,</span><span> 214.2KB</span></span>\n<span><span>==</span><span>&gt; </span><span>Installing</span><span> typst</span><span> dependency:</span><span> openssl@3</span></span>\n<span><span>==</span><span>&gt; </span><span>Pouring</span><span> openssl@3-3.6.3.arm64_ohos.bottle.tar.gz</span></span>\n<span><span>Error:</span><span> No</span><span> such</span><span> file</span><span> or</span><span> directory</span><span> @</span><span> rb_file_s_rename</span><span> -</span><span> (/storage/Users/currentUser/.harmonybrew/share/man/man3/OPENSSL_version_build_metadata.3ssl, </span><span>/data/storage/el2/base/haps/entry/files/Homebrew/Backup/share/man/man3/OPENSSL_version_build_metadata.3ssl</span><span>)</span></span></code></pre></figure>\n<p>解决办法：建个目录就好了。</p>",
